==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-au-get rid of.ogg|Audio (AU)|lang=en}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|gets rid of|getting rid of|got rid of|past_ptc2=gotten rid of}}

# {{lb|en|transitive|idiom}} to [[dispose]] (of); to [[remove]]; to [[abolish]]; to [[lose]]
#: ''I want to '''get rid of''' your influence over my life!''

